Subject: [PATCH 435/443] [ae-patch] Fold a long approval message on the
 approved card and the standalone approve page

AeClampedMessage (patch 0433) only wrapped the pending chat card. The responded chat card and ApprovePage still printed the whole policy message, so they now use it too: three lines with a Show more toggle when the text overflows.
